/// indexed for semantic search, where related query terms will match the
/// attribute value even if they are not stemmed or keyword matches. If a
/// field is indexed technical identifier search, it will be annotated with
/// @amazon.datazone#searchable(modes:["TECHNICAL"]) . If a field is indexed
/// for lexical search (supports stemmed and prefix matches but not semantic
/// matches), it will be annotated with
/// @amazon.datazone#searchable(modes:["LEXICAL"]) . A field storing
